Welcome to my travel site!  You have just entered into the realms of MyBigAdventure&trade;, a fun-filled website chronicling my 6 month cross-country, clockwise romp around the Continental United States, starting and ending in Portland, Oregon.  Both descriptive and picture-filled, this website is an extensive journal of my fascinating adventure.  
