<p>
A lot of ground was covered in my travels, a total of 18,218 miles to be exact.  In the process I passed through 36 states, biked more than 500 miles, hiked more than 100 miles, visited 20 parks, saw tons of interesting sights, and met a lot of great folks, including family, friends, and acquaintances.
